 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 6.13,
   "text": "In nineteen forty-nine, a psychologist wrote one sentence about how brains learn.",
   "dur": 5.78,
   "voiced": 412,
   "sim": 0.712,
   "f0": 118.779,
   "st": -0.177,
   "range_st": 5.228,
   "asr": 0.828,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 7.392,
   "e": 15.084,
   "text": "Seventy-seven years later, that sentence is hiding inside every chatbot you have ever talked to.",
   "dur": 7.692,
   "voiced": 376,
   "sim": 0.724,
   "f0": 114.935,
   "st": -0.747,
   "range_st": 5.821,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 15.465,
   "e": 17.763,
   "text": "Just not where anyone expected it.",
   "dur": 2.298,
   "voiced": 101,
   "sim": 0.721,
   "f0": 116.295,
   "st": -0.543,
   "range_st": 3.692,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 18.523,
   "e": 23.767,
   "text": "To find it, we first have to understand why every attempt to build a brain-like AI has failed.",
   "dur": 5.244,
   "voiced": 320,
   "sim": 0.852,
   "f0": 116.908,
   "st": -0.452,
   "range_st": 6.432,
   "asr": 0.947,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 25.12,
   "e": 26.956,
   "text": "Welcome to this technical masterclass.",
   "dur": 1.835,
   "voiced": 106,
   "sim": 0.746,
   "f0": 119.884,
   "st": -0.017,
   "range_st": 9.08,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 27.176,
   "e": 32.656,
   "text": "Look around at the current frontier of artificial intelligence:",
   "dur": 5.48,
   "voiced": 307,
   "sim": 0.655,
   "f0": 116.033,
   "st": -0.582,
   "range_st": 4.614,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 32.869,
   "e": 39.389,
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra, Anthropic's Claude 5.5, Google DeepMind's Gemini 4, and Mythos.",
   "dur": 6.52,
   "voiced": 419,
   "sim": 0.84,
   "f0": 118.575,
   "st": -0.207,
   "range_st": 5.297,
   "asr": 0.933,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 40.412,
   "e": 45.343,
   "text": "Across every benchmark in mathematical reasoning, software synthesis, and multi-turn dialogue,",
   "dur": 4.931,
   "voiced": 382,
   "sim": 0.827,
   "f0": 115.659,
   "st": -0.638,
   "range_st": 4.94,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 45.524,
   "e": 49.761,
   "text": "these systems exhibit remarkable cognitive capabilities.",
   "dur": 4.237,
   "voiced": 301,
   "sim": 0.648,
   "f0": 118.561,
   "st": -0.209,
   "range_st": 2.732,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 50.097,
   "e": 55.998,
   "text": "Yet behind the dazzling demonstrations lies a profound and unsettling architectural truth.",
   "dur": 5.901,
   "voiced": 397,
   "sim": 0.778,
   "f0": 114.644,
   "st": -0.791,
   "range_st": 3.822,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 57.175,
   "e": 63.985,
   "text": "Every single foundational model in production today is a frozen, static monolith of computation.",
   "dur": 6.81,
   "voiced": 460,
   "sim": 0.863,
   "f0": 120.373,
   "st": 0.054,
   "range_st": 5.937,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 65.011,
   "e": 68.619,
   "text": "Consider the computational lifecycle of a modern language model.",
   "dur": 3.608,
   "voiced": 302,
   "sim": 0.819,
   "f0": 118.628,
   "st": -0.199,
   "range_st": 7.206,
   "asr": 0.842,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 69.869,
   "e": 71.523,
   "text": "Over several months of pre-training,",
   "dur": 1.654,
   "voiced": 114,
   "sim": 0.727,
   "f0": 130.871,
   "st": 1.501,
   "range_st": 6.932,
   "asr": 0.833,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 71.76,
   "e": 76.155,
   "text": "clusters of tens of thousands of GPUs consume millions of kilowatt hours",
   "dur": 4.395,
   "voiced": 334,
   "sim": 0.849,
   "f0": 115.897,
   "st": -0.602,
   "range_st": 3.831,
   "asr": 0.917,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 76.407,
   "e": 81.37,
   "text": "to optimize hundreds of billions of numerical parameters across trillions of tokens.",
   "dur": 4.963,
   "voiced": 351,
   "sim": 0.805,
   "f0": 131.717,
   "st": 1.613,
   "range_st": 6.283,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 82.712,
   "e": 89.352,
   "text": "During this training epoch, the system learns by updating its numerical weights through stochastic gradient descent.",
   "dur": 6.64,
   "voiced": 410,
   "sim": 0.851,
   "f0": 120.544,
   "st": 0.078,
   "range_st": 8.06,
   "asr": 0.938,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 90.232,
   "e": 93.392,
   "text": "But the exact instant that training completes,",
   "dur": 3.16,
   "voiced": 204,
   "sim": 0.86,
   "f0": 120.091,
   "st": 0.013,
   "range_st": 3.236,
   "asr": 0.857,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 93.929,
   "e": 96.651,
   "text": "the learning process halts forever.",
   "dur": 2.722,
   "voiced": 122,
   "sim": 0.754,
   "f0": 114.525,
   "st": -0.809,
   "range_st": 9.45,
   "asr": 0.8,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 97.588,
   "e": 101.512,
   "text": "The neural weights are etched into silicon like ancient stone monuments.",
   "dur": 3.924,
   "voiced": 279,
   "sim": 0.792,
   "f0": 120.584,
   "st": 0.084,
   "range_st": 7.616,
   "asr": 0.818,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 102.183,
   "e": 109.702,
   "text": "When you query the model at inference time, whether you ask it to compose a simple haiku or prove a subtle theorem in algebraic geometry,",
   "dur": 7.519,
   "voiced": 588,
   "sim": 0.848,
   "f0": 117.992,
   "st": -0.292,
   "range_st": 5.376,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 109.85,
   "e": 111.915,
   "text": "not a single synapse moves.",
   "dur": 2.065,
   "voiced": 120,
   "sim": 0.764,
   "f0": 125.516,
   "st": 0.778,
   "range_st": 6.827,
   "asr": 0.8,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 112.844,
   "e": 114.725,
   "text": "No new connections form.",
   "dur": 1.881,
   "voiced": 119,
   "sim": 0.76,
   "f0": 125.874,
   "st": 0.827,
   "range_st": 8.247,
   "asr": 0.75,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 114.913,
   "e": 116.999,
   "text": "No outdated pathways dissolve.",
   "dur": 2.086,
   "voiced": 124,
   "sim": 0.755,
   "f0": 115.924,
   "st": -0.598,
   "range_st": 6.504,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 4,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 117.57,
   "e": 123.901,
   "text": "The network cannot dynamically reallocate its internal routing topology to adapt to the complexity of your request.",
   "dur": 6.331,
   "voiced": 517,
   "sim": 0.812,
   "f0": 119.512,
   "st": -0.071,
   "range_st": 3.837,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 125.238,
   "e": 128.619,
   "text": "In our live terminal, examine the attention implementation.",
   "dur": 3.38,
   "voiced": 276,
   "sim": 0.658,
   "f0": 120.692,
   "st": 0.099,
   "range_st": 5.956,
   "asr": 0.875,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 128.987,
   "e": 137.933,
   "text": "The projection weights, W Q, W K, and W V, are loaded into GPU high-bandwidth memory as fixed FP16 tensors.",
   "dur": 8.946,
   "voiced": 630,
   "sim": 0.858,
   "f0": 119.436,
   "st": -0.082,
   "range_st": 5.812,
   "asr": 0.718,
   "attempts": 5,
   "level": 2,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 138.333,
   "e": 145.423,
   "text": "Every single incoming token vector is multiplied against these identical, immutable arrays.",
   "dur": 7.09,
   "voiced": 491,
   "sim": 0.823,
   "f0": 127.68,
   "st": 1.074,
   "range_st": 7.046,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 146.696,
   "e": 149.839,
   "text": "While activations change dynamically from token to token,",
   "dur": 3.142,
   "voiced": 230,
   "sim": 0.806,
   "f0": 122.791,
   "st": 0.398,
   "range_st": 8.428,
   "asr": 0.875,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 150.025,
   "e": 153.899,
   "text": "the underlying parametric landscape is completely rigid and invariant.",
   "dur": 3.874,
   "voiced": 295,
   "sim": 0.786,
   "f0": 121.135,
   "st": 0.163,
   "range_st": 7.522,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 155.286,
   "e": 165.622,
   "text": "Why has the entire multi-billion dollar enterprise of artificial intelligence consolidated around this rigid, unyielding architectural paradigm?",
   "dur": 10.336,
   "voiced": 798,
   "sim": 0.707,
   "f0": 115.178,
   "st": -0.71,
   "range_st": 3.313,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "s": 166.322,
   "e": 174.232,
   "text": "In this investigation, we explore the deep mathematical, physical, and hardware forces that created the modern AI monolith...",
   "dur": 7.91,
   "voiced": 490,
   "sim": 0.852,
   "f0": 114.464,
   "st": -0.818,
   "range_st": 7.883,
   "asr": 0.944,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "s": 174.584,
   "e": 183.114,
   "text": "and why the tantalizing dream of truly self-adapting intelligence has proven so fiercely difficult to realize in physical silicon.",
   "dur": 8.53,
   "voiced": 601,
   "sim": 0.83,
   "f0": 116.869,
